<title>GERMANY: Degussa H1 gp pretax profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Degussa H1 gp pretax profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     233     vs 186</p>
<p>    Group sales				  7,231   vs 6,859</p>
<p>    --chemical products			2,036   vs 1,887</p>
<p>    --health and nutrition products	1,524   vs 1,359</p>
<p>    --precious metals and bank	     3,671   vs 3,613</p>
<p>    Precious metals trading turnover     1,959   vs 1,808</p>
<p>    --domestic				   1,729   vs 1,664</p>
<p>    --foreign				    5,502   vs 5,195</p>
<p>    Fixed asset investment		   290     vs 271</p>
<p>    Labour costs				 1,286   vs 1,242</p>
<p>Workforce (headcount as at 31/3/97)  25,591  vs 25,971</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals and precious metals group is Degussa AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
